1. Covered assets ("the Assets")
--------------------------------

* the pixel art: sprites, animation strips, tiles and frames in `frontend/public/pixel/`;
* the UI glyphs in `frontend/public/icons/`;
* the sprite and glyph data generated from them in `frontend/src/hibiscus/*.gen.ts`;
* the mascot "Hibi" (a robot arm holding a hibiscus flower) in every pose, size and mood;
* the hibiscus logo / mark, the "Hibiscus" lockups and the favicons (`frontend/public/favicon.*`,
  `frontend/public/apple-touch-icon.png`);
* the brand images in `assets/brand/` (banners, social preview, logos, wordmarks);
* the screenshots in `docs/ux/screenshots/` insofar as they show the Assets.

The Assets are produced from the private Hibiscus design system (github.com/Bigkatoan/hibiscus-assets);
only the built files above are distributed with Hibiscus. The design sources are not part of this
repository and are not licensed to you.

